The SLO line marks the 600 ms p99 target.

# Weekly data

table lat cols=week,p50,p95,p99 title="Latency by week, ms"

# What changed

W35 spiked after the index migration to the new cluster. Latency recovered once query caching shipped in W37, and p99 has fallen every week since W38.

!! W35 is the only week that breached the SLO, with p99 at 688 ms.
